nd full stack behind. AI made it possible but beyond that, I am working as =
fast as a team of people used to work. I am in flow state basically all the=
 time. I get endorphins from completing features and tests. I am not writin=
g any code just directing the project, I dont even open an editor now. this=
 is not how I expected things to go. it would have taken a year or more to =
