ll still be use cases to optimize code for some purposes where you would wa=
nt to write line by line. We are writing code to solve problems, if there i=
s a better way to solve a problem (using LLM) we will use it if it has a re=
asonable cost.</p><p>-Senior developers will be replaced by Junior develope=
rs that use AI, the junior developer has more ambition, growth mindset and =
motivation to learn to use AI while some Seniors will resist it. The Junior=
 developer as we know it today will be replaced with Senior developers that=
 use AI. Senior developers as we know it today will be replaced by Develope=
rs using AI.</p><p>-There are billions of young people living in poor condi=
tions in Asia which are so hungry to get out of their environment. We are e=
ssentially handing them all of the worlds knowledge in a simple mobile app =
or coding interface. They will be so much more open to this technology than=
 the west ever will be. We will most likely see major economic developments=
 in these countries which is great. Do not be too focused on your own world=
.</p><p>-Looking at history, every time we invent a new technology of this =
amplitude we get a lot of resistance (industrial revolution most recently).=
 However, history has proven that when the productivity of humans takes a l=
eap forward, all humans get it better (boomers are a proof of this). The ne=
w jobs humans will be doing is not clear in the new technologies infancy, w=
hich is why resistance is high. However, our economy is mostly restricted b=
y human time, it is the only finite resource. If we can get more out of eve=
ry human hour or more humans all humans get it better. Sure we will get tri=
llionaire but the whole poverty line and middle class will be moved up as w=
ell.</p></div></div><span class=3D"post-media"><ul data-role=3D"post-media-=
